NNOOTTEESS
       Unlike sseettllooccaallee(3), uusseellooccaallee() does not allow  selective  replacement
       of  individual  locale  categories.  To employ a locale that differs in
       only a few categories from the current  locale,  use  calls  to  dduupplloo‐‐
       ccaallee(3)  and  nneewwllooccaallee(3)  to obtain a locale object equivalent to the
       current locale and modify the desired categories in that object.

